    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f Become a Samurai in the Battle for Survival!</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>2D fighting game set in cyberpunk Japan! Control samurais in battles for 2 to 4 players, fend off waves of cyber-zombies, and enjoy a dynamic synthwave soundtrack. The battle begins!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461670/extras/53a96ea1e71bdebef4d235a8fc8b97a4.poster.avif?t=1744748653\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461670/extras/53a96ea1e71bdebef4d235a8fc8b97a4.webm?t=1744748653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461670/extras/53a96ea1e71bdebef4d235a8fc8b97a4.mp4?t=1744748653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive in the Arena:</strong> Challenge a friend or face off against random opponents in short game sessions to prove your skills!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use the Hordes of Cyber-Zombies:</strong> Think you're about to win? Waves of cyber-zombies with different tactics and behaviors will make every battle unpredictable. Use them to your advantage!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arena Boss:</strong> Better not drag the fight out, or you\u2019ll have to battle not only your opponents but also the arena boss! But no one has ever managed to defeat the boss...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylish Graphics:</strong> Immerse yourself in the futuristic samurai cyberpunk atmosphere with hand-drawn arenas created by an artist from the board game <i>Arkham Horror</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local Co-op:</strong> Gather your friends and engage in intense battles on a single screen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each Arena, a Thousand Tactics:</strong> Use the environment to gain the upper hand, survive as long as possible, and maybe even claim victory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461670/extras/36f9512ab6e9e469163153d299692c9c.avif?t=1744748653\" width=616 height=353 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Who is this game for</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy fast-paced arcade battles, challenging gameplay, and proving your skills in arena fights, this game is for you! Perfect for evening brawls with friends or solo online matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461670/extras/8f8c40dbc1665f8df9e129139c810ee3.avif?t=1744748653\" width=616 height=353 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Ready to Fight?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cyber-zombies are coming\u2026 Grab your katana and join the battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[<strong>Add to your wishlist and get ready for launch!</strong>] \ud83d\udee1\ufe0f</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f Become a Samurai in the Battle for Survival!</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>2D fighting game set in cyberpunk Japan! Control samurais in battles for 2 to 4 players, fend off waves of cyber-zombies, and enjoy a dynamic synthwave soundtrack. The battle begins!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461670/extras/53a96ea1e71bdebef4d235a8fc8b97a4.poster.avif?t=1744748653\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461670/extras/53a96ea1e71bdebef4d235a8fc8b97a4.webm?t=1744748653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461670/extras/53a96ea1e71bdebef4d235a8fc8b97a4.mp4?t=1744748653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive in the Arena:</strong> Challenge a friend or face off against random opponents in short game sessions to prove your skills!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use the Hordes of Cyber-Zombies:</strong> Think you're about to win? Waves of cyber-zombies with different tactics and behaviors will make every battle unpredictable. Use them to your advantage!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arena Boss:</strong> Better not drag the fight out, or you\u2019ll have to battle not only your opponents but also the arena boss! But no one has ever managed to defeat the boss...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylish Graphics:</strong> Immerse yourself in the futuristic samurai cyberpunk atmosphere with hand-drawn arenas created by an artist from the board game <i>Arkham Horror</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local Co-op:</strong> Gather your friends and engage in intense battles on a single screen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each Arena, a Thousand Tactics:</strong> Use the environment to gain the upper hand, survive as long as possible, and maybe even claim victory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461670/extras/36f9512ab6e9e469163153d299692c9c.avif?t=1744748653\" width=616 height=353 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Who is this game for</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy fast-paced arcade battles, challenging gameplay, and proving your skills in arena fights, this game is for you! Perfect for evening brawls with friends or solo online matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461670/extras/8f8c40dbc1665f8df9e129139c810ee3.avif?t=1744748653\" width=616 height=353 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Ready to Fight?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cyber-zombies are coming\u2026 Grab your katana and join the battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[<strong>Add to your wishlist and get ready for launch!</strong>] \ud83d\udee1\ufe0f</p>",
